    "primary": {
     "type": "TextChapter",
     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Radio Group is used when a single option can be chosen from a list of at least two options. Selecting one option will deselect another. Radio Groups are used for example in forms, tables, lists, and filters. Radio Group is not used when multiple options can be chosen. Checkbox or Dropdown are used instead. Furthermore, in case there are four or more options, a Dropdown is typically a better choice.",
